Lettering under Regions: title, second line, the letters' look, where, how (painted with the picture, or on the reference by Qwen-Image 2.1); kept in this browser; the take's title; Clear. Letter it on the stage and in a picture's menu: the picture the reference, the block open, Draw without a prompt. Beside each lettered picture ✓ spelled, ⚠ misspelled (what it reads), ? unread; the run's line says the lettering. Eleven catalogs.

